{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/901630-scion-the-long-road-to-heaven-an-actual-play-podcast","id":901630,"title":"Scion: The Long Road to Heaven - An Actual Play Podcast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-27T18:59:17-07:00","id":901630,"title":"Scion: The Long Road to Heaven - An Actual Play Podcast","content":"Hey there! I've been running a Scion campaign using the Long Road to Heaven campaign from the books, with a couple of my own stories set in between, so that my players could adequately get to the legend they need to. Now, I should give a forewarning, I play with a lot of homebrew, house rules, and I tend to play fast and loose with the rules/mythology. As such I'll sometimes say things that might clash with an established canon within the Scion universe, or go against a rule or two.<br /> <br /> Now, I stream each session over here on my hitbox channel: <a href=\"https://www.hitbox.tv/Kobuddy/videos\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.hitbox.tv/Kobuddy/videos</a> Usually we play every other Sunday, (or the occasional weird dates if we need to make up a date due to players having prior plans.) and will take a couple weeks break in between stories. (We're currently on break as it stands right now.) You can view the videos themselves in chronological order by hitting &quot;recent&quot; on hitbox, and scrolling all the way down. (I also stream videogames and other bullshit, so, apologies for that.)<br /> <br /> Alternatively, I have been slowly uploading our sessions to our group's podbean: <a href=\"http://scotdropandroll.podbean.com/?source=pb\" target=\"_blank\">http://scotdropandroll.podbean.com/?source=pb</a> This is obviously not up to date, but it gives you the benefit of not having to deal with Hitbox and it comes in podcast form. (We also have a Shadowrun podcast, but, I won't mention that too much.) ALSO, as mentioned in the podbean notes, there are audio issues up until about Session 4 I believe. This was just a result of my streaming program acting weird whenever I had my voice chatting program at the fore-front, and refused to record my voice.<br /> <br /> Now then, since we have that all taken care of, let's move to our god kids!<br /> <br /> <b>The Players:</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/XEs2DZe.png\u200b\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/XEs2DZe.png\u200b\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/XEs2DZe.png\u200b\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/XEs2DZe.png\u200b </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Beamsplash</b> as Eddiker Browan, Son of Caananite God Kothar.<br /> <br /> Eddiker is a dork. Plain and simple. However, as the son of a craft god, he is extremely good with making gizmos, as well as just hacking in general. His Aunt Rozalin, who is in on the whole god situation as she Eddiker's guide, supplies him with weapons and explosives that he can use...moderately effectively to make up for his lack of combat ability.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/xDCY2cv.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/xDCY2cv.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/xDCY2cv.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/xDCY2cv.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>BellaDante</b> as Ellie Anahara, Daughter of Polynesian God Tangaroa<br /> <br /> After her visitation, Ellie took it upon herself to protect the oceans. Unfortunately, her definition of &quot;protect&quot; means to assassinate oil barons and the such, who she believes are destroying the ocean and it's beauty. She's still a wizard with a gun, and will still answer the call to fight the titanspawn if her father asks.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/mrFxQwd.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/mrFxQwd.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/mrFxQwd.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/mrFxQwd.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Compufreak99</b> as Mattias Tyrson, Son of the Norse God Tyr<br /> <br /> Mattias got his name from his grandfather, who carved his path in America as a powerful and influential mob boss. This Mattias, however, is currently set to inherit a large corporation, though he's currently in school studying law under Professor Nasr. Despite all this, Mattias is a bruiser flat out, and his punch can bring even the mightiest of foes to their knees.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/TncZGzz.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/TncZGzz.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/TncZGzz.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/TncZGzz.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Grasslamb</b> as Xiu Song, Daughter of the Chinese God Sun Wukong<br /> <br /> Xiu Song is a teenager. To make things worse, she is a teenage scion of Sun Wukong. The apple doesn't far fall from the tree, despite how much she tries to protest it. Always with a spray can in her backpack, Xiu is a swift and nimble fighter who can knock you out before you even notice.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/DMKJFOO.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/DMKJFOO.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/DMKJFOO.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/DMKJFOO.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Goggalor </b>as Hideki Fujioka, Son of the Japanese God Hachiman<br /> <br /> The adopted son of a powerful CEO, Hideki is pretty much the complete opposite of what his father would want. He doesn't exactly have the highest grades, except in Kendo and English. Rather than work for his father, he'd rather protect mortals and fight evil; basically like a superhero.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/66ORJos.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/66ORJos.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://imgur.com/66ORJos.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://imgur.com/66ORJos.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>GoggleFox </b>as Nasr ibn Anoub, Son of the Egyptian God Anubis<br /> <br /> An accomplished law professor, Nasr would rather not deal with this godly nonsense. Though, he's resigned to his fate as his father keeps calling him for mission after mission. What Nasr lacks in combat ability, he makes up for supporting his band by healing them, and also being an excellent talker and interrogator. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imgur.com/t0Nq9gT.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <b>Swari </b>as Felicia Rallis, Daughter of the Greek Goddess Athena<br /> <br /> Felicia is quite possibly the most wealthiest person you'll ever meet. However, if she even says a word to you, count yourself lucky. In spite of never wanting to deal with other people, she is incredibly intelligent, being able to recite knowledge that most people would either forget about or have never even heard of. <b>NOTE: </b>This character was replaced.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imgur.com/yLGW1Ai.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <b>Swari </b>as Lesedi Bello, Daughter of the Loa God Shango<br /> <br /> Born in Africa, Lesedi has made it in life by solving, in her words, &quot;god crimes&quot;. As a young girl, she watched a lot of USA detective shows, which inspired her to do what she does now. She also specializes in helping her team with her wealth of knowledge, thanks to the many cases she has taken and solved.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imgur.com/Le5NiXn.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <b>ZenScissors </b>as Jessica Yakone, Daughter of the Inuit God Tornarssuk<br /> <br /> Jessica is...a wild card. Simple as that. Much like her father, no one quite understands her, and she'll often wander off and do her own thing. Despite this nonsense, she's an accomplished DJ from Alaska, and has enough charisma to make a room get hype like no other. <b>NOTE: </b>This player eventually dropped out.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> So, yeah, I hope y'all enjoy our silly little adventures <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6027-kobuddy","name":"Kobuddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6027_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-28T10:31:34-07:00","id":922714,"title":"","content":"Bumping this up, as I've uploaded a few more sessions to the podbean, and we're nearing the end of the first story in the ones I've uploaded <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6027-kobuddy","name":"Kobuddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6027_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T22:28:28-07:00","id":927453,"title":"","content":"I'll give it a listen tomorrow and let you know what I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2001-tyler-foss","name":"Tyler Foss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}